---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ManagedContent from '../components/ManagedContent';
---
<Base title="FANNYMAGNET — Beyond the body. Beyond the ordinary." description="Explore bodybuilding, sports chemistry and human performance with FANNYMAGNET: independent education on nutrition, evidence and informed choices.">
<div class="fm">
<ManagedContent client:load kind="banner" />
<div class="topline"><span>INDEPENDENT THINKING. INFORMED BODIES.</span><span>SCIENCE / CULTURE / PERFORMANCE</span></div>
<header><a class="wordmark" href="/">FANNYMAGNET<span>®</span></a><div class="header-right"><a href="/account">ACCOUNT ↗</a><a href="/cart" class="bag">BAG <span>↗</span></a></div></header>
<nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/explore">Explore</a><a href="/bodybuilding">Bodybuilding</a><a href="/steroid-awareness">Steroid Awareness <span>↗</span></a><a href="/chemistry">Chemistry</a><a href="/store">Nutrition Store</a><a href="/journal">The Journal</a><a href="/about">About</a></nav>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> BEYOND THE BODY. BEYOND THE ORDINARY.</div><h1><span class="sr-only">FANNYMAGNET. </span>YOUR BODY<br/>IS <span class="acid">CHEMISTRY.</span><br/>UNDERSTAND<br/>WHAT YOU<br/>PUT INTO IT<span class="acid">.</span></h1><p>Exploring bodybuilding, sports chemistry, performance science and the substances that influence the human body.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/explore">EXPLORE THE SCIENCE <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/store">ENTER THE STORE ↗</a></div><div class="hero-foot"><span>NO HYPE. NO SHORTCUTS. JUST UNDERSTANDING.</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="art-top"><span>THE HUMAN EXPERIMENT</span><span>VOL. 001 / EST. 2026</span></div><div class="image-slot" id="hero-photo"><svg class="molecule" viewBox="0 0 400 360" fill="none" aria-label="Stylized molecular illustration"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M40 130L105 90L170 130V205L105 245L40 205ZM170 130L235 90L300 130V205L235 245L170 205M300 130L350 100L390 155L365 220L300 205M105 90V25M40 205L10 235M235 245V310"/><circle cx="105" cy="25" r="12"/><circle cx="235" cy="310" r="12"/></g></svg><span class="art-code">HUMAN<br/>POTENTIAL.<br/>UNDER THE<br/>MICROSCOPE.</span><span class="vertical">FIG. 01 — THE SCIENCE OF BECOMING</span><div class="orbit">C₁₉H₂₈O₂<br/><small>ASK BETTER QUESTIONS.</small></div></div><div class="art-caption"><span>THE BODY IS NOT A BLACK BOX.</span><span>OPEN IT UP ↗</span></div></div></section>
<div class="ticker"><span>BODYBUILDING IS BIOLOGY</span><b>✳</b><span>KNOW THE MOLECULE. QUESTION THE CLAIM.</span><b>✳</b><span>EDUCATION BEFORE ENHANCEMENT</span><b>✳</b></div>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span>01 / THE BIG QUESTION</span><a href="/steroid-awareness">STEROID AWARENESS ↗</a></div><div class="investigation"><div><span class="label">THE COVER STORY</span><h2>MORE MUSCLE.<br/>AT WHAT COST?</h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">Anabolics change more than your physique. Understanding the mechanisms is only half the story.</p><p>Explore hormonal feedback, cardiovascular health, fertility and the gap between gym-floor mythology and clinical evidence. Information without glorification. Context without judgment.</p><a class="button" href="/steroid-awareness">READ THE INVESTIGATION ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span>02 / UNDER THE SURFACE</span><a href="/chemistry">THE CHEMISTRY LIBRARY ↗</a></div><div class="topic-grid">{[{n:'01',title:'ANABOLIC CHEMISTRY',sub:'Receptors. Hormones. Feedback loops.',url:'/steroid-awareness',symbol:'C₁₉H₂₈O₂'},{n:'02',title:'CREATINE, EXPLAINED',sub:'Small molecule. Important questions.',url:'/chemistry#creatine',symbol:'C₄H₉N₃O₂'},{n:'03',title:'THE PROTEIN QUESTION',sub:'From amino acids to adaptation.',url:'/chemistry#protein',symbol:'NH₂—CHR—COOH'}].map(t=><a class="topic" href={t.url}><span>{t.n} / FIELD NOTES</span><div class="formula">{t.symbol}</div><h3>{t.title} ↗</h3><p>{t.sub}</p></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="store-band section"><div class="section-heading"><span>03 / FUEL, NOT FICTION</span><a href="/store">NUTRITION STORE ↗</a></div><div class="store-heading"><h2>LESS NOISE.<br/>BETTER BASICS.</h2><p>Learn what an ingredient does before you put it in your shaker. An evidence-led approach to sports nutrition.</p><a class="button" href="/store">EXPLORE THE STORE ↗</a></div><div class="product-tease"><a href="/store#protein"><span>01 / PROTEIN</span><div class="pack pack-ivory"><small>FANNYMAGNET / NUTRITION STUDIES</small><strong>PROTEIN<br/>IN FOCUS.</strong><span>EDUCATIONAL CATEGORY STUDY</span></div><h3>Build your understanding. ↗</h3></a><a href="/store#creatine"><span>02 / CREATINE</span><div class="pack pack-purple"><small>FANNYMAGNET / NUTRITION STUDIES</small><strong>CREATINE.<br/>NO MYSTERY.</strong><span>EDUCATIONAL CATEGORY STUDY</span></div><h3>Go beyond the label. ↗</h3></a></div><p class="fine">Concept packaging illustrates our editorial categories, not products for sale. Only verified manufacturer-labelled products will be available to purchase.</p></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span>04 / THE JOURNAL</span><a href="/journal">ALL STORIES ↗</a></div><div class="journal-list">{[{tag:'BODYBUILDING / CULTURE',title:'The body was never just a body.',text:'Training culture, identity and the archive.',url:'/bodybuilding'},{tag:'SCIENCE / RESEARCH',title:'Evidence is not a headline.',text:'How to read a study without buying the hype.',url:'/journal'},{tag:'NUTRITION / FIELD NOTES',title:'Before the scoop. Read the label.',text:'A more considered approach to supplements.',url:'/chemistry'}].map((a,i)=><a href={a.url}><span>0{i+1}</span><div><small>{a.tag}</small><h3>{a.title}</h3><p>{a.text}</p></div><b>↗</b></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="newsletter section" id="newsletter"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE FANNYMAGNET DISPATCH</span><h2>STAY CURIOUS.<br/>STAY INFORMED.</h2><p>Research, culture and considered perspectives. No miracle promises.</p><a class="button" href="/about#contact">JOIN THE DISPATCH ↗</a></div><div class="newsletter-mark">F<span>↗</span></div></section></main>
<footer><a class="wordmark" href="/">FANNYMAGNET</a><div><p>BEYOND THE BODY. BEYOND THE ORDINARY.</p><p>Independent education. Not medical advice. No steroid sales, sourcing or instructions.</p></div><div><a href="/about">ABOUT / CONTACT ↗</a><a href="/admin/login" id="home-admin-link" style="display:none">ADMIN ↗</a><script>
async function showAdministratorLink(){
  const link=document.getElementById('home-admin-link');
  if(!link)return;
  link.style.display='none';
  try{
    const response=await fetch('/api/admin?action=me',{credentials:'same-origin',cache:'no-store'});
    if(!response.ok)return;
    const session=await response.json();
    if(typeof session.role==='string'&&session.role.length>0)link.style.removeProperty('display');
  }catch{}
}
showAdministratorLink();
window.addEventListener('pageshow',showAdministratorLink);
document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',showAdministratorLink);
</script><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} FANNYMAGNET</span></div></footer>
</div>
<style is:global>
:root{--background:#10110e;--foreground:#eeeae0;--card:#191a16;--card-foreground:#eeeae0;--primary:#dc143c;--primary-foreground:#fff7ef;--accent:#b6a1c9;--accent-foreground:#10110e;--muted:#252620;--muted-foreground:#aaa99e;--secondary:#d17d50;--secondary-foreground:#10110e;--border:#3c3d34;--input:#3c3d34;--ring:#dc143c;--brand:#dc143c;--accent-color:#b6a1c9}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--background);color:var(--foreground)}*{box-sizing:border-box}.fm{max-width:1920px;margin:auto}.topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 3.5%;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.7px}.fm header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 3.5%}.wordmark{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,43px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-2.2px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.wordmark span{font-size:13px;vertical-align:top;letter-spacing:0}.header-right{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:11px;align-items:center}.header-right a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.bag{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 16px}.bag span{padding-left:25px}.fm nav{padding:16px 3.5%;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:12px}.fm a{transition:color .2s}.fm nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.fm nav a:hover,.text-link:hover{color:var(--primary)}.fm nav span{color:var(--primary)}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr 1fr;padding:34px 3.5% 30px;gap:30px}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.dot{height:6px;width:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary)}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,6.1vw,100px);font-weight:800;line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:31px 0 23px}.acid{color:var(--primary)}.hero p{font-size:13px;max-width:350px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted-foreground)}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;margin-top:27px;flex-wrap:wrap}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-foreground);padding:16px 21px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3px}.button:hover{background:var(--accent)}.text-link{color:inherit;font-size:10px;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.hero-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:17px;margin-top:33px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.7px}.hero-art{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-foreground);display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:580px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.art-top,.art-caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:15px 17px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1px;position:relative;z-index:2}.art-caption{border-top:1px solid currentColor}.image-slot{flex:1;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(130deg,transparent 35%,var(--secondary) 130%)}.hero-image{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(1);mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.85}.image-slot:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent,transparent 2px,rgba(16,17,14,.08) 3px);pointer-events:none}.molecule{position:absolute;width:74%;right:-15%;top:4%;z-index:2;opacity:.6}.art-code{position:absolute;left:22px;top:30px;font-size:clamp(20px,2.7vw,42px);line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1.5px;z-index:2}.vertical{position:absolute;right:14px;top:40%;writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:2px;z-index:2}.orbit{position:absolute;bottom:28px;left:22px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:50%;height:145px;width:145px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;transform:rotate(-15deg);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;z-index:2;background:var(--primary)}.orbit small{font-size:6px;margin-top:7px;letter-spacing:.7px}.ticker{background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-foreground);padding:17px 3.5%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.6px}.ticker b{font-size:18px;line-height:1}.section{padding:57px 3.5%}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:16px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px}.section-heading a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.investigation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:8%;padding-top:37px}.label{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--secondary);color:var(--secondary);padding:6px 8px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1px}.fm h2{font-size:clamp(35px,4.8vw,74px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-3px;font-weight:800;margin:20px 0}.investigation p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted-foreground);line-height:1.7}.investigation .large-copy{font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--foreground)}.investigation .button{margin-top:17px}.topic-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:27px;gap:18px}.topic{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:25px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;min-height:255px}.topic>span{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1px}.formula{height:125px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,39px);color:var(--accent);font-family:monospace}.topic:nth-child(2) .formula{color:var(--primary)}.topic:nth-child(3) .formula{color:var(--secondary)}.topic h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.topic p{color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:11px}.store-band{background:var(--foreground);color:#10110e}.store-band .section-heading{border-color:var(--muted-foreground)}.store-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}.store-heading h2{grid-row:span 2}.store-heading p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;max-width:340px;margin-top:30px}.store-heading .button{justify-self:start}.product-tease{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:30px}.product-tease a{background:var(--border);padding:23px;color:var(--foreground);text-decoration:none}.product-tease a>span{font-size:9px}.pack{margin:35px auto;width:65%;max-width:300px;min-height:235px;border-radius:5px 5px 28px 28px;transform:rotate(-5deg);box-shadow:15px 18px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:25px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--background);border-top:12px solid var(--background)}.pack-ivory{background:var(--foreground)}.pack-purple{background:var(--accent);transform:rotate(5deg)}.pack small,.pack>span{font-size:7px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px}.pack strong{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px,3vw,38px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1.5px}.product-tease h3{font-size:14px}.fine{font-size:10px;line-height:1.6}.journal-list>a{display:flex;gap:27px;align-items:center;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.journal-list>a>span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted-foreground)}.journal-list>a>div{flex:1}.journal-list small{font-size:8px;color:var(--secondary);letter-spacing:1px}.journal-list h3{font-size:clamp(20px,2.7vw,38px);letter-spacing:-1.4px;margin:7px 0}.journal-list p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground);margin:0}.journal-list b{font-size:30px}.newsletter{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-foreground);align-items:center}.newsletter p{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:25px}.newsletter-mark{font-size:230px;font-weight:800;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-30px}.newsletter-mark span{font-size:100px;vertical-align:top}footer{padding:40px 3.5%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;align-items:start}footer .wordmark{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-1.4px}footer p,footer a,footer span{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.5px}footer p+ p{color:var(--muted-foreground);max-width:300px;line-height:1.7}footer>div:last-child{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}footer a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}@keyframes fmEnter{from{transform:translateY(18px);opacity:.25}to{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1}}.hero-copy{animation:fmEnter .7s ease-out}.hero-art{animation:fmEnter 1s ease-out}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}@media(min-width:1500px){.hero{gap:60px}.hero h1{font-size:100px}}@media(max-width:850px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.hero h1{font-size:7vw}.hero-art{min-height:490px}.actions{gap:18px}.hero-foot span:last-child{display:none}.fm nav{font-size:10px;overflow-x:auto;justify-content:start;white-space:nowrap}.investigation{gap:30px}.fm h2{letter-spacing:-2px}.newsletter-mark{font-size:160px}.topic{padding:17px}.topline span:last-child{display:none}footer{flex-wrap:wrap}}@media(max-width:580px){.fm header{padding:23px 5%}.header-right{gap:12px;font-size:8px}.header-right>a:first-child{display:none}.wordmark{font-size:29px}.hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:26px 5%}.hero h1{font-size:14vw;margin-top:25px}.hero p{font-size:13px}.hero-art{min-height:440px}.art-code{font-size:35px}.hero-foot{margin-bottom:6px}.hero .eyebrow{font-size:8px}.section{padding:39px 5%}.investigation,.store-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.investigation .large-copy{margin-top:0}.topic-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.topic{min-height:220px}.formula{height:100px;font-size:35px}.store-heading h2{grid-row:auto}.store-heading p{margin:0}.product-tease{gap:12px}.product-tease a{padding:12px}.pack{width:95%;min-height:190px;padding:15px 10px;margin:25px auto}.pack strong{font-size:24px}.pack small,.pack>span{font-size:5px}.product-tease h3{font-size:11px}.newsletter-mark{display:none}.section-heading{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.3px}.ticker{font-size:10px}.journal-list>a{gap:15px}footer{padding:30px 5%}.fm h2{font-size:42px}.hero-art .orbit{width:125px;height:125px}.topline{padding:10px 5%;font-size:7px}}
</style>
